{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Vanessa Works the Evening Shift", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Staying up All Night", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 7, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 6, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": " Identify and describe events in the news in a range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Talking about Cause and Effect - The Zero Conditional", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You use the Zero Conditional when you are absolutely certain of the result.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you use the Zero Conditional, you don't think of the future, the past, or the present. We think only of a simple fact. <br/>It means: If something happens, then the result is always the same.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"><span class=\\\"italic\\\">If</span></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">condition</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">result</span>\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Simple</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Simple</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I leave home late,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I miss my bus.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" you leave your coffee on the table,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" it gets cold.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I don't eat breakfast, \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I can't think at work.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "If I stay up all night, I am useless the next day.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If we watch all the episodes back to back, it takes much less time.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " First & Second Conditional Sentences", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " In these other conditional sentences, we think about the future. We think about a particular condition in the future and the result of this condition.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "In the First Conditional, there is a real possibility that this condition will happen.<br/><span class=\"italic\">Example: If I get a raise, I will take you out for dinner.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "In the Second Conditional, there isn't a real possibility that this condition will happen.<br/><span class=\"italic\">Example: If I won the lottery, I would travel the world.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "First Conditional:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">If</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Condition</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Result</span>\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Simple</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> will + base verb</span>\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" If it rains,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I will take the bus to work.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Second Conditional:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">If</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Condition</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Result</span>\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Past Simple</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> would + base verb</span>\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" If it rained next weekend, \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" the company picnic would be cancelled.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Examples</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"First Conditional\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul> <li>If I'm done early, I'll come over.</li> <li>If the director approves it, he will grant me similar projects in the future.</li> <li>If I move up in this company, I could retire at 55.</li> <li>If we keep working at this pace, we won't make it to 55.</li> <li>If you love Jack Bauer as much as I know you do, you won't miss my party.</li></ul></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Second Conditional\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li> If I did something relaxing, it would take my mind off work. </li> <li>If you listened to her, you would be happier too.</li></ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "useless", "type": "name"}, {"content": "cannot be used to do anything", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If I stay up all night, I am useless the next day.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about work-life balance.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "deadline", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the last day you must do something ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The deadline for Peter's marketing plan is Monday.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to retire", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to not work anymore, usually after 60 or 65 years of age", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If I become an executive in this company, I could retire at 55.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to approve", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to accept a plan as good", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If the director approves my marketing plan, I would be very happy.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to grant", "type": "name"}, {"content": "agree to give or allow", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If the director accepts my marketing plan, he will grant me similar projects in the future.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "definitely", "type": "name"}, {"content": "for sure; for certain", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I will definitely think about balancing my work life with my social life.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob07aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "pace", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the speed at which someone moves or something happens", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If we keep working at this pace, we won't make it to 55 years of age.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob07aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Think of a time when you stayed up all night doing something.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a story (10 sentences). Include:  <ul><li>who invited you</li><li>what you did during the night</li><li>how you felt the next day</li><li>whether you would do it again</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "If you haven't had this experience, imagine what you would do if you stayed up all night.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use 3-4 conditional sentences.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your story to a partner. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask your partner if they would do the same thing.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I discuss past events.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about conditional situations.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I discuss wishes and experiences with a partner.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn7le06ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le06ob07re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn7le06ob07re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn7le06ob07re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Mmm, Peter, I'm planning this TV marathon Saturday night. Can you come?<br/>\nWe're going to watch the final season of <span class=\"italic\">24</span>, which is actually only 12 hours.<br/>\n<span  class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: 12 hours? If I stay up all night, I am useless the next day.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, if we watch all the episodes back to back with no commercials, it's actually only 8 hours.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn7le06ob07re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span  class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Actually, I have a deadline at work for this marketing plan. I need to work through the weekend. If I'm done early, I'll come over.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Vanessa told me that if I did something relaxing, it would take my mind off work. If you listened to her, you would be happier too.", "time": "22000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn7le06ob07re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span  class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I know. It's my first major marketing plan. If the director approves it, he will grant me similar projects in the future. If I move up in this company, I could retire at 55.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: If we keep working at this pace, we won't make it to 55. If you love Jack Bauer as much as I know you do, you won't miss my party.<br/>\n<span  class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I will definitely think about balancing my work life with my social life.", "time": "40000", "id": 3}]}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about jobs, work, and staying healthy.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about cause and effect.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about wishes and imaginary situations. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What do you think about staying up all night to watch movies?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " How do you balance your work and your social life?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"